  - m_Id: 349
    m_Localized: Workers cannot reach the front work position. Move or rotate the
      facility to open a path. Progress and consumed inputs are preserved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 348
    m_Localized: The next cycle starts after all completed goods enter storage. Picking
      them up does not complete delivery.
